  'mcp.agentSetup.prompt': 'Configure AIGC Radar MCP for me.\n\nTarget client: {client}\nConfiguration target: {target}\nServer URL: {endpoint}\nExecution shell: {shell}\n\nInspect the existing configuration first, then run the command below. If it only creates an import file, merge or import aigc-news into the target client without overwriting other MCP settings. When finished, verify that aigc-news connects and lists its tools; diagnose and fix any errors. Do not repeat or expose the Token from the command in replies, logs, or commits, and do not write it into project files.\n\nSetup command:\n```sh\n{command}\n```',
